wip/openusd: Import openusd-26.08

OpenUSD (Universal Scene Description) for 3D scene interchange and
composition, with Hydra.  Built with Python bindings, imaging and
UsdImaging, Hydra Storm on Metal (HgiMetal compiles its shaders at run
time) and OpenGL, the Embree Hydra renderer, MaterialX support, and
the Alembic, Draco, OpenImageIO, OpenColorIO, OpenVDB and Ptex
plugins.  usdview is not built (needs PySide6); usdrecord needs
PySide6 for its GL context, but UsdAppUtils.FrameRecorder renders
with Storm (Metal) and Embree without it.

Patched to install plugins in lib/usd/plugin and the CMake package
config in lib/cmake/pxr instead of top-level PREFIX directories.
Legacy .pyc files written next to the Python sources are removed.
